OL,3,ANoel Gallagher and Susan Sarandon among
OL,4,Acelebrities to sign Drumcree march
OL,5,Aletter
OL,6,
OL,7,FOasis' Noel Gallagher, Oscar winner
OL,8,FSusan Sarandon and Line of Duty star
OL,9,FAdrian Dunbar are among dozens to sign
OL,10,Fa letter in support of residents in a
OL,11,Fstand-off over a decision to allow a
OL,12,Fparade down a predominantly nationalist
OL,13,Froad.
OL,15,FThere has been 11 days of deadlock
OL,16,Fbetween Garvaghy Road residents and the
OL,17,Flocal Orange Order over the proposed
OL,18,Fmarch in Portadown, County Armagh.
OL,20,FWhile peaceful, the stalemate has
OL,21,Freopened what was once the most bitter
OL,22,Fparading dispute in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
